{"seq":3,"slug":"critical-care-monitoring-basics","title":"重症监护基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/critical-care-monitoring-basics","wordCount":1136,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"重症监护基础\">重症监护基础</h1><p>第一次走进 ICU，我被满屋子的报警声和闪烁的数字吓到了：监护仪、呼吸机、输液泵、各种管路缠在病人身上。带教老师说，这些机器不是用来&quot;吓人&quot;的，每一个数字都是病人某个生命系统的实时状态。学会读懂它们，你就能在病情恶化前一步发现问题——这正是重症护理的价值所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>重症监护（ICU）</strong> 收治的是器官功能衰竭或随时可能恶化的危重病人，特点是&quot;持续监测、及时干预&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>多功能监护仪</strong> 实时显示心电、心率、血压、血氧、呼吸等参数，护士要会看波形、会设报警界限。</li>\n<li><strong>机械通气</strong> 是重症常见支持手段，护士护理重点是气道管理、防误吸、防呼吸机相关性肺炎。</li>\n<li><strong>意识评估</strong> 用格拉斯哥昏迷评分（GCS），从睁眼、语言、运动三方面打分。</li>\n<li>重症护理的灵魂是<strong>早期识别病情恶化</strong>，靠的是把多项参数综合判断，而不是盯单一数字。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"监护仪上的数字怎么读\">监护仪上的数字怎么读</h3><p>监护仪不是越多报警越好，关键是设对报警界限并理解趋势。常看的几个参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>心率与心电波形</strong>：识别危险心律（如室速、室颤）。</li>\n<li><strong>血氧饱和度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SpO</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}\\_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"mord\">_2</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 提示低氧，要查找原因。</li>\n<li><strong>有创/无创血压</strong>：危重病人常用动脉置管连续测压，比袖带更及时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>护士要警惕&quot;假报警&quot;麻痹——报警太频繁容易让人忽视真报警，所以要根据病人情况合理设界限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"机械通气病人的护理\">机械通气病人的护理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[机械通气护理] --&gt; B[气道管理: 吸痰 湿化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[防误吸: 床头抬高30到45度]&#10;    A --&gt; D[口腔护理: 防VAP]&#10;    A --&gt; E[镇静评估: 避免过深或躁动]\">flowchart TD\n    A[机械通气护理] --&gt; B[气道管理: 吸痰 湿化]\n    A --&gt; C[防误吸: 床头抬高30到45度]\n    A --&gt; D[口腔护理: 防VAP]\n    A --&gt; E[镇静评估: 避免过深或躁动]</pre><p>呼吸机相关性肺炎（VAP）是机械通气最常见的并发症，预防措施被打包成&quot;集束化护理&quot;：抬高床头 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30^\\circ{\\sim}45^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每日评估能否撤机、规范口腔护理、手卫生。这种把多条循证措施捆绑执行的做法，正是现代重症护理的特色。</p>\n<h3 id=\"意识评估-格拉斯哥昏迷评分\">意识评估：格拉斯哥昏迷评分</h3><p>GCS 把意识量化成分数，便于客观交班和判断趋势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估项</th>\n<th>分值范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>睁眼反应（E）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1{\\sim}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言反应（V）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1{\\sim}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动反应（M）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1{\\sim}6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= E + V + M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，最高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分（清醒），最低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 分提示昏迷、需考虑气道保护。用分数交班远比&quot;病人有点迷糊&quot;更准确，也能看出病情是好转还是恶化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出入量与内环境监测\">出入量与内环境监测</h3><p>重症病人内环境极易紊乱，护士要精确记录每小时尿量（反映肾灌注，正常约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> mL/(kg⋅h)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\ \\text{mL/(kg·h)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL/(kg⋅h)</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上）、各类引流和补液量，配合监测电解质和血气。出入量失衡往往是病情变化的早期信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位 ICU 病人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续报警在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">88\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88%</span></span></span></span></span>，你应该先排查哪些可能原因？</li>\n<li>机械通气病人为什么要抬高床头 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30^\\circ{\\sim}45^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>？这预防的主要并发症叫什么？</li>\n<li>用 GCS 给一位&quot;刺痛才睁眼、只能发出含糊声音、刺痛能定位&quot;的病人估算总分。</li>\n<li>为什么说重症护理要&quot;看趋势、看组合&quot;，而不能只盯一个数字？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解集束化护理（care bundle）的概念，体会现代重症护理为什么强调把多条循证措施打包执行。</li>\n<li>关注 2026 年国家把重症监护列为护士培训补短板重点方向的政策，重症护士需求持续增长。</li>\n<li>找机会观摩一次监护仪的报警设置，理解&quot;合理设界限&quot;对避免报警疲劳的重要性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>重症监护的核心是持续监测加早期识别。监护仪上的每个数字都代表一个生命系统，护士要看波形、设报警、读趋势。机械通气护理重在气道管理和预防 VAP，集束化护理是现代标准。GCS 让意识评估变得客观可交班，精确的出入量记录能提前发现病情变化。重症护理拼的不是盯单一数字，而是综合判断。第二章到此完整，下一章我们走进专科护理，看妇儿急危重这些特殊场景的护理逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重症监护基础","id":"重症监护基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"监护仪上的数字怎么读","id":"监护仪上的数字怎么读"},{"level":3,"text":"机械通气病人的护理","id":"机械通气病人的护理"},{"level":3,"text":"意识评估：格拉斯哥昏迷评分","id":"意识评估-格拉斯哥昏迷评分"},{"level":3,"text":"出入量与内环境监测","id":"出入量与内环境监测"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"外科护理与围手术期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/surgical-nursing-and-perioperative-care"},"next":{"title":"母婴护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/maternal-and-child-nursing"}}